\thispagestyle{empty}
\begin{center}
\vspace*{0.3in}

\begin{tikzpicture}
  \draw[ScriptureGold, line width=0.8pt] (-2.8,0) -- (-0.55,0);
  \fill[ScriptureGold] (0,0) circle (0.055);
  \draw[ScriptureGold, line width=0.8pt] (0.55,0) -- (2.8,0);
\end{tikzpicture}

\vspace{0.22cm}
{\Large\bfseries\color{ChapterIndigo} 全書一句話 \textperiodcentered\ The Whole Book in One Verse}

\vspace{0.30cm}
\fcolorbox{ScriptureGold}{ScriptureBg}{%
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\centering\vspace{0.2cm}
\normalsize\color{CommentaryBrown}
要照所安排的，在日期滿足的時候，\textbf{\color{MysteryGold!80!black}使天上、地上、一切所有的}\\
\textbf{\color{MysteryGold!80!black}都在基督裏面同歸於一}。\\[0.5em]
\footnotesize\itshape
With a view to an administration suitable to the fullness of the times,\\
\textbf{that is, the summing up of all things in Christ},\\
things in the heavens and things on the earth.\\[0.4em]
\small\color{ChapterIndigo} 以弗所書 1:10 \textperiodcentered\ Ephesians 1:10
\vspace{0.2cm}
\end{minipage}}

\vspace{0.35cm}
{\small\color{TextGray} 六章 \textperiodcentered\ 三卷 \textperiodcentered\ 一句同歸於一的計劃\\
\textit{Six chapters \textperiodcentered\ three volumes \textperiodcentered\ one plan to sum up all things in Christ}}

\vspace{0.30cm}
{\small
\renewcommand{\arraystretch}{1.3}
\begin{tabular}{@{}p{2.8cm}p{2.4cm}p{6.9cm}@{}}
\toprule
\textbf{段落} & \textbf{章節} & \textbf{在全書的展開} \\
\midrule
你的地位（坐） & 1-3章 & 神在創立世界以前所定的計劃：揀選、救贖、印記、猶太外邦合一、藉教會顯明奧秘 \\
你的行為（行） & 4-5章 & 既然蒙召，就當怎樣行：合一與恩賜、脫舊穿新、光明中的智慧、家庭的次序 \\
你的站立（站） & 6章 & 神所賜的全副軍裝，抵擋那並不是屬血氣的仇敵 \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
}

\vspace{0.4cm}
\textcolor{ScriptureGold}{\rule{2.5in}{0.7pt}}
\vspace{0.3cm}

{\bfseries\color{ChapterIndigo} 讀經之鑰 \textperiodcentered\ How to Read This Book}

\vspace{0.18cm}
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\small\color{TextGray}
不是來讀一份行為清單，是先看清神已經為你做成的事，這身分才有東西可活出來。\\
若你讀完六章卻只記得末了的軍裝——請從頭再讀，\\
這次留意：軍裝穿在最後，是因為前五章先給了一個可以站立的地位。\\[0.5em]
\textit{\footnotesize
You are not reading a checklist of behaviors — you are first seeing what God
has already done, so that this identity has something to live out.\\
If after six chapters you remember only the armor at the end, read it again.\\
This time notice: the armor comes last because the first five chapters gave
you a position to stand on.}
\end{minipage}

\vfill
{\scriptsize\color{LightGray} PubHub 三書精讀系統 \textperiodcentered\ Soli Deo Gloria}

